+"""HTTP server classes.
+
+From Python 3.3
+
+Note: BaseHTTPRequestHandler doesn't implement any HTTP request; see
+SimpleHTTPRequestHandler for simple implementations of GET, HEAD and POST,
+and CGIHTTPRequestHandler for CGI scripts.
